<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Interview Lab · 面试稿教练</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-glow"></div>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="header">
      <a class="logo" href="/">
        <span class="logo-mark">IL</span>
        Interview Lab
      </a>
      <p class="tagline">Turn every interview into your next advantage.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- 顶部页面切换 -->
    <nav class="page-nav">
      <button class="page-tab active" data-page="quick">快速投递</button>
      <button class="page-tab" data-page="review">面试复盘</button>
    </nav>

    <!-- ========== Page 1: 快速投递 ========== -->
    <section id="page-quick" class="page-section">
      <div class="hero-mini">
        <h1>从帖子一键找到公司招聘</h1>
        <p>支持粘贴链接、直接粘贴文字，或上传截图，自动提取公司并提供搜索路径。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-card">
        <div class="tabs" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <button class="tab active" data-extract-tab="url">粘贴链接</button>
          <button class="tab" data-extract-tab="text">粘贴文字</button>
          <button class="tab" data-extract-tab="image">上传截图</button>
        </div>

        <!-- 链接 -->
        <div id="extract-url-pane">
          <label class="url-label">帖子链接</label>
          <div class="url-row">
            <input id="post-url" type="url" placeholder="https://... 粘贴小红书/脉脉/知乎等链接">
            <button id="extract-btn" class="btn-primary">提取公司 →</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 文字 -->
        <div id="extract-text-pane" class="hidden">
          <label class="url-label">帖子正文</label>
          <textarea id="post-text" rows="6" placeholder="把帖子里的文字直接复制粘贴到这里…"></textarea>
          <div style="margin-top: 12px; text-align: right;">
            <button id="extract-text-btn" class="btn-primary">提取公司 →</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 截图 -->
        <div id="extract-image-pane" class="hidden">
          <label class="url-label">上传截图（支持手机拍照 / 相册 / 拖拽）</label>
          <label class="dropzone" for="post-image" id="image-dropzone">
            <input id="post-image" type="file" accept="image/*" capture="environment">
            <div class="upload-icon">📷</div>
            <div class="upload-text">
              <strong>点击或拖入截图</strong>
              <span>识别图中文字后自动提取公司，不会上传保存图片</span>
            </div>
          </label>
          <p id="image-preview-name" class="status"></p>
          <div style="margin-top: 12px; text-align: right;">
            <button id="extract-image-btn" class="btn-primary" disabled>提取公司 →</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p id="extract-status" class="status"></p>
        <p id="extract-error" class="error"></p>
      </div>

      <div id="company-results" class="company-results hidden"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- ========== Page 2: 面试复盘 ========== -->
    <section id="page-review" class="page-section hidden">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <span class="badge">AI INTERVIEW COACH</span>
          <h1>YOUR INTERVIEW<br><em>HAS MORE TO SAY.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-desc">粘贴录音转写稿或上传 PDF，几分钟内得到优先级明确的改进点、原文证据，以及下一轮可直接练习的追问。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <div class="holo-card">
            <div class="holo-inner">
              <div class="holo-label">MIRA</div>
              <div class="holo-title">3D AI Coach</div>
              <div class="holo-status">Ready</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="workspace">
        <div class="input-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="step">01</span>
              <h2>放入你的面试稿</h2>
            </div>
            <label class="role-label">
              目标岗位
              <input id="role" type="text" placeholder="例如：产品经理">
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="tabs">
            <button class="tab active" data-tab="paste">粘贴文字</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="pdf">上传 PDF</button>
          </div>

          <div id="paste-pane">
            <textarea id="transcript" placeholder="把面试录音转写稿粘贴在这里…&#10;&#10;建议保留提问和回答的原始顺序，分析会更准确。"></textarea>
          </div>

          <div id="pdf-pane" class="hidden">
            <label class="dropzone" for="pdf-file">
              <input id="pdf-file" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf">
              <div class="upload-icon">↑</div>
              <div class="upload-text">
                <strong>选择一份 PDF 文字稿</strong>
                <span>只读取可复制文本的 PDF，不会保存文件</span>
              </div>
            </label>
            <p id="pdf-status" class="status"></p>
          </div>

          <div class="actions">
            <span class="privacy">内容只在本次分析中处理，不会被保存</span>
            <button id="analyze" class="btn-primary">开始分析 →</button>
          </div>
          <p id="error" class="error"></p>
        </div>

        <aside class="guide-card">
          <span class="step">02</span>
          <h3>好稿的三个信号</h3>
          <ul class="signals">
            <li><strong>先结论</strong><span>让面试官快速抓住重点</span></li>
            <li><strong>有证据</strong><span>案例、数据和你的具体动作</span></li>
            <li><strong>能复盘</strong><span>讲清判断、取舍与下一步</span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="sample-box">
            <span>不知道怎么开始？</span>
            <button id="load-sample">试试示例文字稿 →</button>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section id="results" class="results hidden" aria-live="polite"></section>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer class="footer">
    Interview Lab · 仅作练习参考，请结合真实经历调整表述
  </footer>

  <script type="module" src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
